<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro is designed for players who are starting to use anchors or don't know exactly how to use them.
4 -for anchor
5 -for glowstone
g - for totem

bind the macro to 4

NOTICE: If you are on high ping, the macro may fail so try to tweak the delay a little bit to see what works for you!</Description>
    <Comment>комментария нету,позже еще один макрос сделаю. Доброго вечера</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 33 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 33 1
Delay 20 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 20 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 34 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 34 1
Delay 20 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 20 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 10 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 10 1
Delay 15 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 15 ms
RightUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>